					"nextDialogs": [
						740821003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821003,
					"content": "哇，珀西芙，你是怎么突然冒出来的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821004,
					"content": "无影踪，珀西芙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821005,
					"content": "好吧…你真是我见过的最特别的美露莘…对了，我印象中的美露莘，大多都生活在枫丹廷或者海沫村…你怎么会在这里呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821006,
					"content": "枫丹廷？海沫村？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821007,
					"content": "看你好像很疑惑的样子，你没听过这两个名字吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821008,
					"content": "枫丹廷，美露莘…海沫村，美露莘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821009,
					"content": "啊…伊黎耶，珀西芙，家乡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821010,
					"content": "伊黎耶，珀西芙，守护！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821011,
					"content": "等等，你说这里是你的家乡？你在守护你的家乡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821012,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821013,
					"content": "可是美露莘的家乡是海沫村吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821014
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740821014,
					"content": "是啊，好奇怪，还有出生在别的地方的美露莘吗？可这里看起来也没有其他美露莘了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821015,
					"content": "珀西芙，你都是一个人生活在这里的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821016
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821016,
					"content": "一个人？美露莘。那位来客！珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821017,
					"content": "那…那位来客？还有一位来客？哪位来客？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821018
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821018,
					"content": "#那位来客！派蒙，派蒙，{NICKNAME}，{NICKNAME}，那位来客，那位来客！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821019
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821019,
					"content": "所以那位来客是谁？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821020
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740821020,
					"content": "珀西芙…你不会是想说，就像派蒙叫派蒙一样，那位来客就叫那位来客？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821021
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821021,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821022
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821022,
					"content": "啊哈！果然是这样，我就说，我也是很聪明的嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821023,
						740821024
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821023,
					"content": "这名字太怪了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821025
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740821024,
					"content": "这名字太酷了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821025
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740821025,
					"content": "那位来客，珀西芙，知识，邦邦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821026
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821026,
					"content": "嗯…你是说那位来客帮你学会知识？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821027
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821027,
					"content": "珀西芙！十分很多。语言，智慧…十分很多。",
