					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821031
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821031,
					"content": "美露莘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821032
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821032,
					"content": "是你帮他守护这里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821033
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740821033,
					"content": "珀西芙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821034
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821034,
					"content": "居然是这样…那位来客究竟是什么人？他为什么需要你帮他守护这里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821035
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821035,
					"content": "而且这里确实发生了一些不好的事，我们看到的石碑，上面的字都被人毁掉了，而且刚才也看见了不少污秽…是敌人吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821036
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821036,
					"content": "好奇派蒙，珀西芙！但是时间，十分很不多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740821037
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珀西芙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740821037,
					"content": "钥匙，钥匙，钥匙，广场，西。邦邦，邦邦…",
